{
  "schema_version": "1.0",
  "encounter_id": "00232",
  "segments": [
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0001",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 0.77,
      "end_seconds": 6.86,
      "duration_seconds": 6.09,
      "text": "Hi doctor, sorry, the lift was out and I had to take the stairs."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0002",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 8.26,
      "end_seconds": 10.99,
      "duration_seconds": 2.73,
      "text": "Yes, do sit. Tell me what's been happening."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0003",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 11.5,
      "end_seconds": 23.42,
      "duration_seconds": 11.92,
      "text": "I've been dealing with numbness on the left side of my face. I've never really been one for hospitals. I looked a few things up online, and that probably didn't help."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0004",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 23.8,
      "end_seconds": 30.14,
      "duration_seconds": 6.34,
      "text": "Is this recent, or has it been a while? I ask because it helps me narrow things down."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0005",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 31.5,
      "end_seconds": 39.75,
      "duration_seconds": 8.25,
      "text": "For two weeks, I'd say. I'm hoping you can tell me something definite. Sorry, I know I'm rambling a bit."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0006",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 40.72,
      "end_seconds": 48.28,
      "duration_seconds": 7.56,
      "text": "Can you describe it a bit more for me? How strong it is, what the pattern is, what helps."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0007",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 53.08,
      "end_seconds": 65.17,
      "duration_seconds": 12.09,
      "text": "Moderate, I'd say. Honestly, on and off. It's a relief to finally sit down and talk about it. I thought it would sort itself out, but it hasn't."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0008",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 65.58,
      "end_seconds": 69.34,
      "duration_seconds": 3.76,
      "text": "Sorry about the noise outside, the building work never stops."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0009",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 70.46,
      "end_seconds": 73.34,
      "duration_seconds": 2.88,
      "text": "Uh, I hadn't even noticed, honestly."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0010",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 73.65,
      "end_seconds": 77.45,
      "duration_seconds": 3.8,
      "text": "Let me check a few things. Any trouble swallowing or chest pain?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0011",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 78.6,
      "end_seconds": 82.68,
      "duration_seconds": 4.08,
      "text": "I haven't had trouble swallowing or chest pain, no."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0012",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 84.14,
      "end_seconds": 88.98,
      "duration_seconds": 4.84,
      "text": "What medicines do you take regularly? I'm asking so that we don't miss anything."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0013",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 89.9,
      "end_seconds": 97.69,
      "duration_seconds": 7.79,
      "text": "Hmm, it's metformin, 500 milligrams, twice a day. My sister suggested writing things down, but I forgot."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0014",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 98.09,
      "end_seconds": 101.97,
      "duration_seconds": 3.88,
      "text": "I'll try to keep this as efficient as I can."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0015",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 102.96,
      "end_seconds": 104.88,
      "duration_seconds": 1.92,
      "text": "Thank you, I appreciate it."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0016",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 105.51,
      "end_seconds": 106.58,
      "duration_seconds": 1.07,
      "text": "Do you smoke?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0017",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 107.09,
      "end_seconds": 110.14,
      "duration_seconds": 3.05,
      "text": "I smoke, yes, around five a day."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0018",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 110.97,
      "end_seconds": 112.36,
      "duration_seconds": 1.39,
      "text": "Do you drink alcohol?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0019",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 115.86,
      "end_seconds": 119.2,
      "duration_seconds": 3.34,
      "text": "A beer or two most evenings, to be honest."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0020",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 120.06,
      "end_seconds": 126.16,
      "duration_seconds": 6.1,
      "text": "What about allergies, to medicines or foods or anything else? Just so I get the full picture."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0021",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 128.96,
      "end_seconds": 132.54,
      "duration_seconds": 3.58,
      "text": "I'm allergic to peanuts, I get my lips swelling."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0022",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 136.72,
      "end_seconds": 139.86,
      "duration_seconds": 3.14,
      "text": "Moving on to your background, any past medical history?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0023",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 140.79,
      "end_seconds": 146.74,
      "duration_seconds": 5.95,
      "text": "I have diabetes. I'm not great at remembering details, so bear with me."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0024",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 147.43,
      "end_seconds": 151.76,
      "duration_seconds": 4.33,
      "text": "What about family history, any illnesses that run in the family?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0025",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 152.42,
      "end_seconds": 153.88,
      "duration_seconds": 1.46,
      "text": "My brother has asthma."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0026",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "NURSE",
      "start_seconds": 155.06,
      "end_seconds": 167.41,
      "duration_seconds": 12.35,
      "text": "Doctor, I've got the readings for you. BMI works out to 28.7, height 170 centimetres, weight 83 kilos, BP is 168 over 92, temp 36.4 degrees, pulse is 73 beats a minute."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0027",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 167.94,
      "end_seconds": 170.57,
      "duration_seconds": 2.63,
      "text": "Thanks. How's everything else at home otherwise?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0028",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 171.04,
      "end_seconds": 178.04,
      "duration_seconds": 7.0,
      "text": "I mean, busy. Everyone's running in different directions at the moment, you know how it is."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0029",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 179.0,
      "end_seconds": 181.65,
      "duration_seconds": 2.65,
      "text": "Let me double-check something in your record."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0030",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 182.42,
      "end_seconds": 184.36,
      "duration_seconds": 1.94,
      "text": "Of course, take your time."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0031",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 194.99,
      "end_seconds": 207.63,
      "duration_seconds": 12.64,
      "text": "Okay, here we go. From what you've told me, it fits best with a possible mini-stroke, which we need to investigate urgently. That's my thinking for now, and it may change as we learn more."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0032",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 208.6,
      "end_seconds": 210.83,
      "duration_seconds": 2.23,
      "text": "Should I be worried about this?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0033",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 211.78,
      "end_seconds": 228.8,
      "duration_seconds": 17.02,
      "text": "I can't promise yet, but most people with a possible mini-stroke, which we need to investigate urgently do well once it's treated properly. Let me just recap so I've got it right. You've had numbness on the left side of your face for two weeks, moderate, and no trouble swallowing or chest pain."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0034",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 233.11,
      "end_seconds": 235.35,
      "duration_seconds": 2.24,
      "text": "Exactly, that's what's been happening."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0035",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 236.23,
      "end_seconds": 239.97,
      "duration_seconds": 3.74,
      "text": "Do you need me to explain anything as we go?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0036",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 240.57,
      "end_seconds": 246.47,
      "duration_seconds": 5.9,
      "text": "Just tell me in plain language, please. I'm not good with the medical terms."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0037",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 247.73,
      "end_seconds": 256.23,
      "duration_seconds": 8.5,
      "text": "I'm going to order a carotid scan, for possible stroke. That will help us see what's going on underneath and decide the next step."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0038",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 256.67,
      "end_seconds": 259.35,
      "duration_seconds": 2.68,
      "text": "Sure, where do I go for that?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0039",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 259.81,
      "end_seconds": 270.95,
      "duration_seconds": 11.14,
      "text": "I'd like you to take clopidogrel, 75 milligrams, once a day, until we review. That should help with stroke prevention. The pharmacy will go through the details again when you pick it up."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0040",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 272.05,
      "end_seconds": 272.92,
      "duration_seconds": 0.87,
      "text": "Okay, doctor."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0041",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 274.27,
      "end_seconds": 283.59,
      "duration_seconds": 9.32,
      "text": "Don't drive for now, and bring someone with you to the next visit. A short walk every day, even twenty minutes, will help more than you'd think."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0042",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 283.86,
      "end_seconds": 286.71,
      "duration_seconds": 2.85,
      "text": "Okay. I'll also refer you to the stroke clinic."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0043",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 287.07,
      "end_seconds": 289.7,
      "duration_seconds": 2.63,
      "text": "So, sure, where do I go?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0044",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 291.07,
      "end_seconds": 302.75,
      "duration_seconds": 11.68,
      "text": "Keep an eye out, and if the numbness, weakness or speech problem returns, call us the same day or go to emergency. I'd like to see you again in one week."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0045",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 303.55,
      "end_seconds": 307.1,
      "duration_seconds": 3.55,
      "text": "Sure, I'll make the appointment on the way out."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0046",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 308.13,
      "end_seconds": 312.86,
      "duration_seconds": 4.73,
      "text": "Let me check that I've been clear. What will you do once you get home?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0047",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 313.78,
      "end_seconds": 322.06,
      "duration_seconds": 8.28,
      "text": "So, I take the clopidogrel, 75 milligrams, once a day and come back in one week. Is that right?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0048",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 323.14,
      "end_seconds": 327.49,
      "duration_seconds": 4.35,
      "text": "Yes, exactly right. We're all set. Don't leave without asking if something's unclear."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0049",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 328.37,
      "end_seconds": 331.65,
      "duration_seconds": 3.28,
      "text": "That's all, thank you for your time."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0050",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 332.17,
      "end_seconds": 334.4,
      "duration_seconds": 2.23,
      "text": "Bye for now, look after yourself."
    }
  ]
}